<%- include ./partials/header.ejs %>
<!--This page serves as an introduction/splash page for my site-->
  <section>
    <h1>Welcome to my Student Grading System!</h1>
    <p>This site will allow you, the student, to enter and track your grades
    for various different courses. You will be able to enter a course, a
    description(such as a quiz, test, or exam), and a percentage grade expressed
    as a number from 0-100. After entering grades, you will be able to view them in a 
    table format, as well as edit and/or delete grades you have already created. A sample
    table will be displayed below, to show you what it might look like when you have entered 
    multiple different grades/courses. This table serves as a visual aid only, and will not be
    interactable like your created table will be. To make a schedule, click the "CRUD" link in 
    the top banner of the page. To return to this page from the CRUD page, click the "HOME" link, 
    also located in the top banner.
    </p>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <td class="bold-underline">Course</td>
        <td class="bold-underline">Description</td>
        <td class="bold-underline">Grade</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Math</td>
